<resources>
    <string name="alarm_admin_description">Adds a step before uninstalling Five More. You can turn protection off in the app or in device admin settings.</string>
    <string name="alarm_admin_explanation">While protection is on, deactivate the device administrator before uninstalling Five More. The app cannot erase data, change your password or lock the screen. You can turn protection off at any time in Phone check or in system settings.</string>
    <string name="power_menu_guard_label">Five More – power menu</string>
    <string name="power_menu_guard_description">Closes recognized power menus only while a real alarm is ringing. First turn on protection in Phone check. It uses system window information and never reads, saves or shares app content. You can turn it off at any time. Some phones are unsupported. It cannot prevent a forced restart with hardware buttons.</string>
